\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl186\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  God gives the king of nation\cf0 
\par \pard\li225\sl186\slmult0 great pow'r and dominion;
\par for him to rule his people
\par in all his righteousness.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par He shall by all perfect way
\par take care of his people
\par And those in trouble he makes
\par them feel so well and cared.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl186\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  He makes the rain to come down,
\par \pard\li225\sl186\slmult0 and watered all the fields.
\par In his days shall the righteous
\par flourish in aboundance.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Peace shall endure forever
\par for all his pure judgment.
\par He shall judge them with his love
\par his kingdom shall endure.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl186\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  His reign shall be forever
\par \pard\li315\sl186\slmult0 from the east to the west,
\par from the sea and to the sea,
\par and unto all the lands.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par People shall come from afar
\par to come and worship him;
\par and for those who all hate him,
\par shall fall and be distroyed.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl186\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  The poor and all the needy
\par \pard\li315\sl186\slmult0 shall come to worship him,
\par and the life of their spirit
\par shall ever be renewed.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par They shall all be delivered
\par with power and the might.
\par Because their life is precious,
\par \pard        they shall not be distroyed.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

